    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="168" width="400" height="40">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="20" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(0,48,135,1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false">
        <p>项目背景</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="216" width="400" height="220">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(71,85,105,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>传统体检中心在检查项维护、体检预约、结果记录等环节依赖纸质单据与人工登记，存在易错、难追溯、协作成本高等问题。</p>
        <p>本项目以桌面端管理软件为载体，将检查项与检查组维护、患者预约、医生录入结果、历次跟踪统一纳入一个系统，实现体检业务的信息化管理。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="168" width="400" height="40">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="20" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(0,48,135,1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false">
        <p>设计目标</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="216" width="410" height="220">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(71,85,105,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45">
        <ul>
          <li><p>数据统一管理：检查项、检查组、预约、结果集中入库，全程可追溯</p></li>
          <li><p>双角色协同：医生负责维护与录入，患者自助预约并查看跟踪</p></li>
          <li><p>结构可维护：按大功能拆分 Maven 多模块，便于多人并行开发</p></li>
        </ul>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="60" startY="470" endX="900" endY="470">
      <border color="rgb(212,229,247)" width="1"/>
